# Coder prompts

Short handoffs to paste into a coder conversation. Copy the note body; Obsidian YAML properties are notebook metadata. Prompts identify design files by filename/title so they work on another machine.

| Prompt | Purpose | Authority |
|---|---|---|
| [[Resources/Coder Prompts/benchmark-runner\|benchmark-runner]] | CLI task runner for AI4Research: durable parallel execution and safe evidence export through a shared execution interface | Latest user handoff; implementation is allowed in our branch, runtime user files are protected |
| [[Resources/Coder Prompts/spark-benchmark-setup\|spark-benchmark-setup]] | Optional direct-host Spark setup using existing containers, bounded storage and verified connectivity | Approved setup handoff; not a benchmark prerequisite or VM/factory implementation |

See [[Workstreams/M1 Design Code and Tests]] for implementation context and [[Designs/Design Library]] for canonical design links. M2 VM labs, factories, container CCs and Spark resource policy remain proposals under [[Designs/Lab Capsule and Factory Design Plan]] and [[Designs/Spark Shared Services and Storage]].
